MIT-sourced attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

TokenBar reads the same on-disk credential locations and quota HTTP endpoints
that the MIT-licensed Syrtis menu-bar app documents and uses:

  - Cursor `state.vscdb` session material and dashboard usage calls
  - Claude Code `~/.claude/.credentials.json`, the macOS
    "Claude Code-credentials" keychain item, and `/api/oauth/usage`
  - Codex `~/.codex/auth.json`, ChatGPT wham usage, and Codex JSONL rollouts

That behavior is reimplemented in original Rust in `crates/tokenbar-core`.
This repository does not contain Syrtis, tokscale-core, or tokcat source,
and it does not copy non-MIT material from those trees.

