Apache-2.0 components linked by the build
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These are crates.io dependencies, not vendored into this tree:

  - gpui-kit and the gpui-pre family (Apache-2.0) — desktop UI
  - gpui-tray (Apache-2.0) — native menu-bar / tray integration
  - reqwest, rusqlite, serde, chrono, base64, dirs, keyring — see each
    crate's license (MIT and/or Apache-2.0)

`keyring` is used on macOS for the login keychain. Other platforms keep
pasted tokens in a mode 0600 file instead of the platform secret service.
